ps://a.storyblok.com/f/104211/140x140/96ec002344/hpcat-paper-disposables.jpg/m/\" alt=\"Paper Disposables\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"><h3>Paper Disposables</h3></a><p>Explore the paper disposables range.</p><a class=\"ah-more\" href=\"/product-categories/paper-disposables\">View range →</a></div><div class=\"ah-product\"><a href=\"/product-categories/wipes\"><img src=\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/104211/140x140/0ba1d3731d/hpcat-wipes.jpg/m/\" alt=\"Wipes\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"><h3>Wipes</h3></a><p>Explore the wipes range.</p><a class=\"ah-more\" href=\"/product-categories/wipes\">View range →</a></div><div class=\"ah-product\"><a href=\"/product-categories/diagnostic-equipment\"><img src=\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/104211/140x140/f93fe35ed3/hpcat-medical-diagnostics.jpg/m/\" alt=\"Diagnostic Equipment\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"><h3>Diagnostic Equipment</h3></a><p>Explore the diagnostic equipment range.</p><a class=\"ah-more\" href=\"/product-categories/diagnostic-equipment\">View range →</a></div><div class=\"ah-product\"><a href=\"/product-categories/hygiene-infection-control\"><img src=\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/104211/140x140/90b5954db6/ms-hp-category-1.png/m/\" alt=\"Hygiene & Infection Control\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"><h3>Hygiene & Infection Control</h3></a><p>Explore the hygiene & infection control range.</p><a class=\"ah-more\" href=\"/product-categories/hygiene-infection-control\">View range →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"ah-about\"><h2>Affinity Healthcare Supplies</h2><p>Medical and care essentials for homes, care providers and businesses. Browse our departments for disposable gloves, first aid, personal care, diagnostic equipment and hygiene supplies.</p><p>For product availability, prices or a bulk order quotation, contact our team on <a href=\"tel:07563139084\">07563 139084</a> or <a href=\"mailto:info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk\">info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"ah-service-strip\"><div><strong>Everyday care essentials</strong><span>Medical and care supply departments</span></div><div><strong>Business enquiries</strong><span>Care homes and professional buyers</span></div><div><strong>Bulk order support</strong><span>Discuss your requirements with us</span></div><div><strong>Here to help</strong><span>07563 139084</span></div></div><div class=\"ah-footer\"><div><h3>Affinity Healthcare Supplies</h3><p>Affinity Healthcare Services Ltd</p><p>1st Floor, Interchange Building<br>81–85 Station Road<br>Croydon, CR0 2RD</p><a href=\"mailto:info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk\">info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk</a></div><div><h3>Company Information</h3><a href=\"/about-us\">About us</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact us</a><a href=\"/faqs\">FAQs</a></div><div><h3>Customer Service</h3><a href=\"/refund-policy\">Returns & refunds</a><a href=\"/terms-conditions\">Terms & conditions</a><a href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy policy</a><a href=\"/cookie-policy\">Cookie policy</a></div><div><h3>Shop by department</h3><a href=\"/product-categories/disposable-gloves\">Disposable gloves</a><a href=\"/product-categories/hygiene-infection-control\">Hygiene & infection control</a><a href=\"/product-categories/first-aid-safety\">First aid & safety</a><a href=\"/product-categories/personal-care\">Personal care</a></div></div><p class=\"ah-copyright\">© 2026 Affinity Healthcare Services Ltd. All rights reserved.</p></div>', 1, 'cotton-wool-rolls-non-sterile-1.jpg', 'homepage', '', 'published', '2025-12-26 09:38:52', '2026-10-28 21:35:52'),
(2, 'About us', '<p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:hsl(240,75%,60%);\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bolder;line-height:inherit;\">Dealing with Affinity Healthcare Services Ltd is simple, safe and secure:</strong></span></p><ul style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;list-style:disc;margin:0px 0px 16px 30px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin-bottom:6px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;\">Having great customer service is very important to us. We know that sometimes it\'s good to speak to someone on the phone and that\'s why we have a friendly sales team of over 20 inbound staff to help you with any queries you have. You can contact them over email, online chat, telephone or fax between 9am - 5pm Monday to Friday. Please see below for contact details, or visit our&nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:transparent;border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,74,137);line-height:inherit;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://www.medisupplies.co.uk/contact\">Contact Us Page.</a></li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin-bottom:6px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;\">All of our websites have genuine SSL certificates that are&nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:transparent;border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,74,137);line-height:inherit;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://seal.godaddy.com/verifySeal?sealID=6hlvHNOdxJ88nV1wH8h81QsyIBaybTUnoSPtzGfa9CsPcgziuXn4Kbb73lL6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">GoDaddy</a>&nbsp;verfied and secured.</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin-bottom:6px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;\">We offer a <strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:bolder;\">number of secure payment options</strong> including BACS, card payments through SagePay, PayPal and Amazon for security and convenience.</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin-bottom:6px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;\">We offer a <strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:bolder;\">30 Day No Quibble Guarantee:</strong> If you are at all dissatisfied with your order simply email us at &nbsp;info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk or call us on 07563139084 to arrange collection and a full refund.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,74,137);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:1.5em;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong>Accreditation and Quality Standards</strong></h2><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">At <strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bolder;line-height:inherit;\">Affinity Healthcare Services Ltd </strong>we respect human rights and do not tolerate any form of modern slavery. We comply with the&nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:transparent;border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,74,137);line-height:inherit;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/649906/Transparency_in_Supply_Chains_A_Practical_Guide_2017.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Modern-Day Slavery Act 2015.</a></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bolder;line-height:inherit;\">Affinity Healthcare Services Ltd</strong> holds a valid&nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:transparent;border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,74,137);line-height:inherit;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://d1x27ksjt2jr18.cloudfront.net/pdf/UK_WDAH_35042.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wholesale Distributors Licence (WDL)</a>&nbsp;and has been approved by the MHRA to sell pharmaceutical medicines within the UK.</p><h2 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,74,137);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:1.5em;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\" id=\"header-ms\"><span style=\"color:hsl(240,75%,60%);\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bolder;line-height:inherit;\">Affinity Healthcare Services Ltd</strong><strong>:</strong></span></h2><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">Over the years we have built long lasting relationships with our customers and they have kindly written over 5000 positive independent and verified reviews across Google and Trustpilot, so you can rest reassured you are in good hands.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">Click below to see what other customers like you think of our products and service.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,74,137);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:1.5em;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\" id=\"header-guarantees\"><strong>Our Customer Guarantees</strong></h2><ul style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;list-style:disc;margin:0px 0px 16px 30px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin-bottom:6px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bolder;line-height:inherit;\">£500 Instant Credit:</strong>&nbsp;We are pleased to offer Instant Credit facilities to established UK organisations, allowing orders to be placed by purchase order and paid within 30 days of invoice. While no formal application or paperwork is required and you only need to select this option at the checkout/when placing your order, we carry out basic verification checks to confirm the legitimacy of the organisation and may check publicly available credit information as appropriate. We reserve the right to approve or decline credit at our discretion.</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin-bottom:6px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bolder;line-height:inherit;\">30 Day No Quibble Guarantee:</strong>&nbsp;If you are at all dissatisfied with your order simply email us at<a href=\"info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk\"> </a>info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk or call us on 07563139084 to arrange collection and a full refund.</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin-bottom:6px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bolder;line-height:inherit;\">Free Delivery:</strong>&nbsp;Orders over £50 before VAT and carriage will automatically qualify for free delivery.</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin-bottom:6px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);\"><span style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bolder;line-height:inherit;\">Price Promise:</strong>&nbsp;seen a better price on a like-for-like product? Call us on 07563139084 or email info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk&nbsp;and we’ll do our best to match or even beat it!</span> &nbsp;</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(0,74,137);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:1.5em;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong>Our Contact Details:</strong></h2><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">Whether you need infection control items, diagnostic sundries, gloves or even tissues, we are sure you will find the ideal product within our range. In the unlikely event that you cannot find what you are looking for, or if you need to contact us, please email us using the link on the store page or use the details below. Please note that our operating hours are Monday-Friday 9am to 5pm, except for bank holidays.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">Affinity Healthcare Services Ltd.&nbsp;<br><a style=\"color:rgb(217, 223, 251);font:700 16px / 26px Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif;touch-action:manipulation;\" href=\"https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&amp;&amp;p=fa7f5af1af8b941109fdfa9528fd06854b0ccde426ead2d8cfb922fc5b7d1cb2JmltdHM9MTc3NDIyNDAwMA&amp;ptn=3&amp;ver=2&amp;hsh=4&amp;fclid=3071d25d-574b-6544-3c90-c45b564b6462&amp;u=a1L21hcHM_Jm1lcGk9NTd--JmNwPTUxLjM3NjMxMn4tMC4wOTY2NzMmdj0yJnNWPTEmRk9STT1NSVJF\" target=\"_blank\" data-h=\"ID=SERP,5615.4\"><u>2 Lansdowne Rd, Broad Green, Croydon, CR9 2ER, England, United Kingdom</u></a></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">Phone: 07563139084<br>Fax: 07563139084<br>Email:&nbsp;info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">We pride ourselves in excellent customer service so if you need to speak to our friendly sales team, either call us on 0800 160 1621 or use our live chat by entering a message into the chat box at the bottom right of your screen.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin:0px 0px 0.5rem;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">Or alternatively get in touch on one of our many social media channels</p>', 1, NULL, 'default', 'Affinity Healthcare Services Ltd has been a registered company in the UK since July 2009. Based in sunny Poole, Affinity Healthcare Services Ltd has now grown to over 150 staff and a huge 30,000sqft of warehouse space. Specialists in medical products, our relationships with suppliers and industry professionals enable us to supply high quality products you use the most at fantastically low prices.', 'published', '2025-12-26 09:38:52', '2026-03-23 12:50:49'),
