0;--tw-skew-y:0;--tw-transform:translateX(0) translateY(0) rotate(0) skewX(0) skewY(0) scaleX(1) scaleY(1);--tw-translate-x:0;--tw-translate-y:0;border:0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;margin:0px;\">Orders for products that are presently in stock and placed before 4:30 pm will be delivered on the next business day. However, please be aware that custom-made items, products shipped directly, pharmaceuticals, vitamins, and supplements may have extended delivery times, and this information will be provided on the product page if relevant. If you have any inquiries or concerns regarding your order, please feel free to contact our team either by sending an email to <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(102,102,102);\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong>info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk</strong></span></span><strong> </strong>or by giving us a call at <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:19px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong>07563139084</strong></span></span>.</p></div></div></div></li></ul></div>', 1, NULL, 'default', 'Below you\'ll find answers to our most commonly asked questions. For any other queries, please reach out to our sales team via live chat, by phone on 07563139084or by email at info@affinityhealthcareltd.co.uk. We\'re available Monday to Friday between the hours of 9:00am-5:00pm.', 'published', '2025-12-26 09:38:52', '2026-03-24 00:36:22'),
(8, 'Contact', '<shortcode>[google-map]502 New Street, Brighton VIC, Australia[/google-map]</shortcode><shortcode>[contact-info-boxes title=\"Contact Us For Any Questions\"][/contact-info-boxes]</shortcode><shortcode>[contact-form][/contact-form]</shortcode>', 1, NULL, 'full-width', '', 'published', '2025-12-26 09:38:52', '2026-03-22 23:20:19'),
(9, 'Cookie Policy', '<h3>EU Cookie Consent</h3><p>To use this Website we are using Cookies and collecting some Data. To be compliant with the EU GDPR we give you to choose if you allow us to use certain Cookies and to collect some Data.</p><h4>Essential Data</h4><p>The Essential Data is needed to run the Site you are visiting technically. You can not deactivate them.</p><p>- Session Cookie: PHP uses a Cookie to identify user sessions. Without this Cookie the Website is not working.</p><p>- XSRF-Token Cookie: Laravel automatically generates a CSRF \"token\" for each active user session managed by the application. This token is used to verify that the authenticated user is the one actually making the requests to the application.</p>', 1, NULL, 'default', NULL, 'published', '2025-12-26 09:38:52', '2025-12-26 09:38:52'),
(10, 'Affiliate', '<h3 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(15,15,15);font-family:Ubuntu, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-style:normal;font-weight:inherit;line-height:30px;margin:0px 0px 10px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:hsl(270,75%,60%);\"><b style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;\"><strong>What to Look for in a Health Affiliate Program</strong></b></span></h3><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(15,15,15);font-family:Ubuntu, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:32px;margin:0px 0px 22px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:400;margin:0px;\">The health and wellness industry is brimming with various health affiliate programs. To determine which health affiliate program you want to promote, you want to consider commission rates, the cookie duration, earns-per-click, and payment structure.</span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(15,15,15);font-family:Ubuntu, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:32px;margin:0px 0px 22px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:hsl(270,75%,60%);\"><b style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;\"><strong>Commission rates</strong></b></span> <b style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;\"><strong>: </strong></b><span style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:400;margin:0px;\">Commissions is the amount you get </span><a style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(242,65,117);font-weight:400;margin:0px;padding:3px;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://influencermarketinghub.com/affiliate-marketing-guide/#toc-3\"><span style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:400;margin:0px;\">paid for every successful sale</span> </a><span style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:400;margin:0px;\">. Look for an affiliate program with a reasonable commission rate.</span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(15,15,15);font-family:Ubuntu, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:32px;margin:0px 0px 22px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:hsl(270,75%,60%);\"><b style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;\"><strong>Cookie duration</strong></b></span> <b style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;\"><strong>: </strong></b><span style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:400;margin:0px;\">Cookie duration varies for every program. The longer the cookie duration, the more opportunities for you to close sales and earn commissions.</span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(15,15,15);font-family:Ubuntu, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:32px;margin:0px 0px 22px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:hsl(270,75%,60%);\"><b style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;\"><strong>Earns per click (EPC)</strong></b></span> <b style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;\"><strong>: </strong></b><span style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:400;margin:0px;\">This is the average amount of earnings you will receive for every hundred clicks your affiliate link receives.</span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(15,15,15);font-family:Ubuntu, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:32px;margin:0px 0px 22px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:hsl(270,75%,60%);\"><b style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);margin:0px;\"><strong>Payment terms:</strong></b></span> <span style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:400;margin:0px;\">Affiliate programs use different methods to forward your payment. Some send payments over bank transfer, PayPal, and even crypto. Check to see whether you have the payment methods supported by the affiliate program.</span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(15,15,15);font-family:Ubuntu, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:32px;margin:0px 0px 22px;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(15,15,15);font-family:Ubuntu, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:32px;margin:0px 0px 22px;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 'default', 'Affiliate marketing is efficient in helping you drive website traffic while earning passive income. Bloggers, influencers, and other content creators benefit from the profits gained through affiliate marketing.', 'published', '2025-12-26 09:38:52', '2026-03-29 17:26:19'),
(11, 'Career', '<figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1080/1080;\" src=\"/storage/online-doctor-healthcare-appointment-flyer-made-with-postermywall.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\"></figure><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span class=\"gs_tkn\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Healthcare careers encompass a wide range of roles, from clinical positions like doctors and nurses to administrative and support roles, with numerous job opportunities available in various settings.</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 'default', '', 'published', '2025-12-26 09:38:52', '2026-03-29 12:02:14'),
(12, 'Coming soon', '<p><img src=\"/storage/wipepod-wipe-dispenser.jpg\" alt=\"wipepod wipe dispenser\" loading=\"lazy\"> <img src=\"/storage/economy-powder-free-vinyl-gloves.jpg\" alt=\"ECONOMY POWDER FREE VINYL GLOVES\" loading=\"lazy\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"/storage/blog-1.jpg\" alt=\"BLOG 1\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><img src=\"/storage/leukoplast-pre-injection-wipes.jpg\" alt=\"leukoplast pre injection wipes\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"/storage/koolpak-compact-instant-ice-packs.jpg\" alt=\"KOOLPAK COMPACT INSTANT ICE PACKS\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><img src=\"/storage/hse-compliant-locking-first-aid-cabinets.jpg\" alt=\"HSE COMPLIANT LOCKING FIRST AID CABINETS\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><img src=\"/storage/cotton-wool-rolls-non-sterile.jpg\" alt=\"COTTON WOOL ROLLS NON STERILE\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><img src=\"/storage/638247631055282568-leukoplast-compress-non-woven-3d-basepackshot-right.jpeg\" alt=\"638247631055282568_leukoplast_compress_non_woven_3d_basepackshot_right\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br>&nbsp;</p><shortcode>[coming-soon time=\"2026-12-26 16:38:52\" image=\"general/coming-soon.jpg\"][/coming-soon]</shortcode>', 1, NULL, 'coming-soon', '', 'published', '2025-12-26 09:38:52', '2026-03-25 20:34:55');
